{"id":"89edd76ad2833409","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Exact Upper Bound Spectrum","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum — ZFC Pcf4 Exact Upper Bound Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum — ZFC Pcf4 Exact Upper Bound Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum — ZFC Pcf4 Exact Upper Bound Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f0456bd04aa601f\" href=\"?note=3f0456bd04aa601f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,h,S\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,h,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\)</span> (exact-upper-bound predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f0456bd04aa601f\" href=\"?note=3f0456bd04aa601f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S(A,J,\\vec f,S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\n\\land S=\\{\\mathrm{cf}(h(a)):a\\in A\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S(A,J,\\vec f,S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\n\\land S=\\{\\mathrm{cf}(h(a)):a\\in A\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The spectrum is taken from one exact upper-bound witness; it is not the union of coordinate spectra over all possible witnesses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f0456bd04aa601f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f0456bd04aa601f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S$ (exact-upper-bound predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality operator, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\vec f,h,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ExactUpperBoundSpectrum}_S(A,J,\\vec f,S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\n\\land S=\\{\\mathrm{cf}(h(a)):a\\in A\\}\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1239,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3085","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-exact-upper-bound-spectrum]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3f0456bd04aa601f","b82cea6742372d50","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}